---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { getLocalizedPath } from '../../i18n/utils';

const siteUrl = 'https://biggan.me';
const canonicalUrl = `${siteUrl}/en/privacy`;

const breadcrumbSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'BreadcrumbList',
  itemListElement: [
    {
      '@type': 'ListItem',
      position: 1,
      name: 'Home',
      item: `${siteUrl}/en`,
    },
    {
      '@type': 'ListItem',
      position: 2,
      name: 'Privacy Policy',
      item: canonicalUrl,
    },
  ],
};
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Biggan.me"
  description="Comprehensive Privacy Policy for Biggan.me covering client-side calculations, LocalStorage usage, Google AdSense cookies, analytics, and student privacy rights."
  lang="en"
  jsonLd={breadcrumbSchema}
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-8">
    <!-- Breadcrumbs -->
    <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <ol class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-slate-400">
        <li>
          <a href={getLocalizedPath('/', 'en')} class="hover:text-cyan-400 transition">Home</a>
        </li>
        <li>/</li>
        <li class="text-cyan-400 font-semibold">Privacy Policy</li>
      </ol>
    </nav>

    <!-- Header Section -->
    <div class="space-y-3">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/30 text-cyan-400 text-xs font-mono">
        Legal & Compliance
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-white tracking-tight">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-base text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
        Effective Date: September 2026. Safeguarding student and visitor privacy while delivering transparent educational computation is fundamental to Biggan.me.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content Policy -->
    <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base space-y-6 leading-relaxed bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-xl">
      
      <!-- Section 1 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-400"></span>
          1. Data Minimization & Pure Client-Side Computation
        </h2>
        <p>
          Biggan.me does not require user accounts, registration, login credentials, or the submission of personally identifiable information (PII) such as real names, phone numbers, or residential addresses.
        </p>
        <p>
          All scientific equations, matrix operations, quadratic formulas, chemical reaction inputs, and code simulator inputs are computed strictly client-side within your browser's JavaScript sandbox. Your numerical inputs and equations are never transmitted to, inspected by, or stored on our servers.
        </p>
      </section>

      <hr class="border-slate-800 my-6" />

      <!-- Section 2 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
          2. Browser LocalStorage Practices
        </h2>
        <p>
          To enhance usability across study sessions without requiring account synchronization, we store minimal non-personally identifiable keys in your browser's <code>localStorage</code>:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 text-slate-300">
          <li><code>theme</code>: Retains your selected color mode (Dark vs. Light).</li>
          <li><code>biggan_consent</code>: Stores your cookie preference selection ('all' vs. 'essential').</li>
          <li><code>ssc_progress_*</code>: Stores offline study checklist milestones on the Revision Progress dashboard.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">
          These items reside exclusively on your physical device. You can erase them at any time by clearing your browser's site data or cookies.
        </p>
      </section>

      <hr class="border-slate-800 my-6" />

      <!-- Section 3 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400"></span>
          3. Google AdSense & Third-Party Advertising Cookies
        </h2>
        <p>
          To sustain server operating expenditures and ensure our computational tools remain freely accessible worldwide, we partner with third-party advertising vendors, including Google LLC (Google AdSense).
        </p>
        <p>
          Google and certified third-party ad networks utilize HTTP cookies (such as the <code>__gads</code>, <code>__gpi</code>, and DoubleClick cookies) to serve programmatic advertisements based on prior visits to this website and other domains across the web.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Your Privacy Choices & Opt-Out Controls:</strong>
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-1.5 text-slate-300">
          <li>You may opt out of personalized ad targeting by visiting Google's official <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-cyan-400 underline">Google Ads Settings</a>.</li>
          <li>You can opt out of third-party behavioral tracking cookies via the Digital Advertising Alliance at <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-cyan-400 underline">aboutads.info</a> or the European Interactive Digital Advertising Alliance at <a href="https://www.youronlinechoices.eu" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-cyan-400 underline">youronlinechoices.eu</a>.</li>
          <li>You can reconfigure your preferences at any time by clicking the <strong>"Cookie Settings"</strong> trigger located in our website footer.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <hr class="border-slate-800 my-6" />

      <!-- Section 4 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-400"></span>
          4. Performance Analytics & Diagnostic Telemetry (GA4)
        </h2>
        <p>
          We utilize Google Analytics 4 to collect aggregated, anonymized telemetry metrics (such as device viewport categories, browser rendering engines, and page load latency). This telemetry enables us to diagnose Core Web Vitals bottlenecks on cellular data networks. We do not transmit PII or mathematical calculation variables to analytics platforms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <hr class="border-slate-800 my-6" />

      <!-- Section 5 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-rose-400"></span>
          5. Children’s Privacy Safeguards (COPPA & GDPR-K)
        </h2>
        <p>
          Biggan.me is a general educational resource. We do not intentionally solicit, harvest, or retain personal data from children under 13 years of age (or under 16 in applicable European jurisdictions). If a parent or guardian discovers that a child has provided personal contact details inadvertently, please alert us immediately for prompt deletion.
        </p>
      </section>

      <hr class="border-slate-800 my-6" />

      <!-- Section 6 -->
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-blue-400"></span>
          6. Contact Information & Data Inquiries
        </h2>
        <p>
          For questions, feedback, or inquiries regarding our privacy compliance and advertising standards, please contact our compliance desk:
        </p>
        <div class="bg-slate-950/70 p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 text-xs sm:text-sm font-mono space-y-1">
          <div>Email: <a href="mailto:privacy@biggan.me" class="text-cyan-400 underline">privacy@biggan.me</a></div>
          <div>Editorial & Support: <a href="mailto:support@biggan.me" class="text-cyan-400 underline">support@biggan.me</a></div>
          <div>Web Desk: <a href="https://biggan.me/en/contact" class="text-cyan-400 underline">biggan.me/en/contact</a></div>
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
